    - Fetch pkg/kubenet.NetworkDevice as client.Object.
    - Build a Ready=False metav1.Condition with reason reasons.ReasonWaitingDependencies and ObservedGeneration set to nd.Generation.
    - Upsert the condition into the untyped map status via upsertConditionGeneric and then call r.Status().Patch(ctx, &updated, client.MergeFrom(&nd)).
    - Added a label-based predicate function and integrity of requeue timing.
  - Added field index: controllers/sonicprovider/indexes.go defines a metadata.labels.network.kubenet.dev/derived index, registered by cmd/sonic-provider at startup.
  - Implemented upsertConditionGeneric in controllers/sonicprovider/conditions.go for untyped map status of Kubenet.NetworkDevice.

- Pinned Kubenet type for watches:
  - pkg/kubenet/types.go defines a minimal NetworkDevice and NetworkDeviceList with Scheme registration and DeepCopyObject implementations, preserving unknown fields so the controller-runtime client treats it as client.Object.

- SRv6 controller scaffolding and CRD:
  - cmd/srv6-controller/main.go boots a manager with healthz/readyz probes, leader election, and graceful shutdown.
  - controllers/srv6service/controller.go reconciler sets ObservedGeneration, writes Ready=False and Degraded=False Conditions with reason reasons.ReasonWaitingDependencies, and requeues.
  - api/v1alpha1/srv6service_types.go defines SRv6Service with validation tags, status subresource, print columns, conditions, and deep-copies in zz_generated.deepcopy.go. Group version wiring is in groupversion_info.go.
